    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract text from a scanned document image, I need to use an external provider. Amazon Textract is a suitable service for this task. I will write the Python code to use the Amazon Textract service to extract text from an image. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789888107749,
